  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: .NET 11 / C# 15 support, multi-targeting net10.0 and net11.0, IsTrimmable/IsAotCompatible verified, EnablePreviewFeatures for latest C# constructs, hardware intrinsics, tiered compilation. 0.2.x: trim- and AOT-compatible (verified, zero analyzer warnings); deterministic, CI-reproducible builds with embedded untracked sources for snupkg symbols. SetRows for equal-width row enumeration without a full input matrix; cell-based and SetValues APIs remain supported.",
